    by threaded Gröbner bases
  * "reduce(LineageTable)" -- see *note reduce: reduce, -- produce a reduced
    Gröbner basis from one computed by threaded Gröbner bases
  * *note tgb: tgb, -- threaded Gröbner bases
  * "tgb(List)" -- see *note tgb: tgb, -- threaded Gröbner bases

